      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2513147645,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Len isn't set when the passed in array is NULL, the official functions aren't inlined but the compatibility function is, so the compiler is able to do some additional checks and notice that len might be used without being initialized if the array is NULL. Though, array can't be NULL with how it's actually used in the dissector, so the compiler's \"maybe\" is wrong. Oh well.",
